+# Plervo Photo
 
-<h1 align="center">PhotoCraft</h1>
+An experimental member of Plervo Suite by AlporT.
 
-<p align="center">
-  <b>Image editing; an open-source, clean-room reimplementation of Adobe Photoshop, rebuilt in pure Rust.</b><br>
-  Layers, masks, adjustment layers, layer styles, type, vectors, brushes and real PSD files,<br>
-  in a native app written entirely in Rust. Open source, offline, and yours.
-</p>
+Adapted from [storytold/photocraft](https://github.com/storytold/photocraft) at `c699e3cda69f4852b43c0b191ab0091aaeff9d6a` (v0.9.0).
+Original authors, copyright notices and MIT/Apache-2.0 licenses are retained. Plervo is an independent distribution.
 
